      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ULTIMATE EVENT (1) was in the money at this track two runs ago before having her colours lowered at her latest appearance over 2130m at this track, beaten 65 metres. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Forgive that last effort. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. GINNIVAN (9) finished in the money at Northam two starts back then did a good job again at his latest appearance over 2242m at at Narrogin, beaten a nose into second after being close to the pace throughout. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Meets a comparable field and he can take care of this line-up. MONTERIO (2) was responsible for a better effort last time out when runner-up over 2242m at Narrogin. Should run a big race. SWEET LOUANNE (3) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 2242m at Narrogin last time out.",
